= Yakov Sverdlov

Yakov Sverdlov is a leading administrator of the party apparatus. 

- @clear_agenda
- @party_unity
- @emergency_fundraising
- @whip
- @build_apparatus
- @root: Return to main

@clear_agenda
title: Clear the agenda
subtitle: Removes all cards from the hand.
choose-if: sverdlov_advisor_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if sverdlov_advisor_timer > 0 : [+ sverdlov_advisor_timer +] weeks before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.sverdlov_advisor_timer = 6;
window.dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.currentHands['main'] = [];
!}

All items from our agenda have been cleared.

@party_unity
title: Party Unity
subtitle: Reduce dissent across the party.
choose-if: sverdlov_advisor_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if sverdlov_advisor_timer > 0 : [+ sverdlov_advisor_timer +] weeks before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: sverdlov_advisor_timer = 4; leninist_dissent -= 5; moderate_dissent -= 10; leftcom_dissent -= 10; b_dissent -= 0.1; 

We have enforced party discipline to reduce dissent across all factions.

@emergency_fundraising
title: Emergency Fundraising
subtitle: An emergency infusion of resources.
choose-if: sverdlov_advisor_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if sverdlov_advisor_timer > 0 : [+ sverdlov_advisor_timer +] weeks before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: sverdlov_advisor_timer = 6; b_resources += b_dues

We have gained +[+ b_dues +] resources.

@whip
title: Whip the Votes 
subtitle: Enforce party discipline in the CEC and promote the Leninist line. 
choose-if: sverdlov_advisor_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if sverdlov_advisor_timer > 0 : [+ sverdlov_advisor_timer +] weeks before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: sverdlov_advisor_timer = 6; leninist_strength += 4; leftcom_strength -= 2; moderate_strength -= 4; b_strength += 0.5; workers_b += 1*(1-b_dissent);

Through careful recruitment, monitoring, and cajoling of delegates, we're able to maintain a reliable fraction in the CEC. 

@build_apparatus
title: Build the Party Apparatus
subtitle: Strengthen our party infrastructure, launch recruitment efforts, and foster greater ties to the provinces.  
choose-if: sverdlov_advisor_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if sverdlov_advisor_timer > 0 : [+ sverdlov_advisor_timer +] weeks before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: sverdlov_advisor_timer = 6; leninist_strength += 2; b_strength += 3; workers_b += 0.5*(1-b_dissent); peasants_b += 2*(1-b_dissent); peasants_unrest -= 5; apparatchiki_strength += 2; provincials_unrest -= 1; provincials_strength += 1; 

The party organizations in the countryside are strengthened, allowing us to attract new talent and better disseminate party directives. 

